<h2 data-split="1" class="disp" style="margin: 0; flex: 1 1 420px; font-size: 52px; line-height: 56px">Who picks up the phone</h2>
<p data-fade="1" style="margin: 0; max-width: 38ch; color: oklch(47.1% 0.028 220.2)">No call centre, no tiers. Whoever answers can fix it, or knows who sits next to the person who can.</p>
